window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Rich boys sin best.</b></p> <p>Gossip always goes around at Falcon Elite Prep. Everyone knows Nate Wilson, the most popular football quarterback and every girl's crush. But there's more behind those drop-dead gorgeous eyes and that killer smile…</p> <p>He's a notorious heartbreaker… And he's got his eyes set on me. The twisted games he plays are cruel and dangerous. He teases and tempts me… just to ruin me.</p> <p>Because I know the one thing he doesn't want anyone to know. A big, dirty secret… And there's nothing bad boys won't do to keep a secret buried.</p> <p>Cruel Boy <i>is an exciting and thrilling dark bully romance standalone novel by </i>New York Times <i>and </i>USA Today <i>bestselling author Clarissa Wild</i>. <i>For mature listeners. Narrated in duet style.</i></p>"; 
